<section class="sec sec--alt" id="work">
  <div class="wrap prof-grid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display" data-en="What it takes off the desk" data-ar="ما يرفعه عن مكتبك">What it takes off the desk</h2>
      <ol class="proc" style="margin-top:32px">
        <li><div><b data-en="Request intake and routing" data-ar="استقبال الطلبات وتوجيهها">Request intake and routing</b><span data-en="Requests from the web, email and WhatsApp sorted and sent to the right team, Arabic first." data-ar="الطلبات من الموقع والبريد وواتساب تُفرز وتُرسل إلى الفريق الصحيح، بالعربية أولاً.">Requests from the web, email and WhatsApp sorted and sent to the right team, Arabic first.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Application checks" data-ar="فحص المعاملات">Application checks</b><span data-en="Applications checked for missing documents before a person picks them up." data-ar="تُفحص المعاملات بحثاً عن المستندات الناقصة قبل أن يتسلّمها موظف.">Applications checked for missing documents before a person picks them up.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Appointments" data-ar="المواعيد">Appointments</b><span data-en="Slots booked, confirmed and reminded. Missed slots offered again." data-ar="تُحجز المواعيد وتُؤكد ويُذكّر بها. والمواعيد الفائتة تُعرض مجدداً.">Slots booked, confirmed and reminded. Missed slots offered again.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Internal approvals" data-ar="الموافقات الداخلية">Internal approvals</b><span data-en="Files move to the next approver with a reminder, and nothing sits unseen." data-ar="تنتقل الملفات إلى المعتمِد التالي مع تذكير، ولا يبقى شيء دون متابعة.">Files move to the next approver with a reminder, and nothing sits unseen.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b data-en="Reports" data-ar="التقارير">Reports</b><span data-en="Weekly and monthly packs drafted from your own systems." data-ar="تقارير أسبوعية وشهرية تُصاغ من أنظمتك.">Weekly and monthly packs drafted from your own systems.</span></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="stays" data-en="What stays with your staff: every decision, approval and signature." data-ar="ما يبقى لموظفيك: كل قرار وموافقة وتوقيع.">What stays with your staff: every decision, approval and signature.</p>
    </div>
    <article class="example">
      <span class="meta" data-en="Example · a permits office" data-ar="مثال · مكتب تصاريح">Example · a permits office</span>
      <h3 data-en="Incomplete applications caught before they reach a desk." data-ar="المعاملات الناقصة تُكتشف قبل أن تصل إلى المكتب.">Incomplete applications caught before they reach a desk.</h3>
      <ol>
          <li><time>08:00</time><span data-en="140 new applications overnight." data-ar="140 معاملة جديدة خلال الليل.">140 new applications overnight.</span></li>
          <li><time>08:20</time><span data-en="The agent checks each one. 31 are missing a document." data-ar="يفحص الوكيل كل واحدة. 31 منها ينقصها مستند.">The agent checks each one. 31 are missing a document.</span></li>
          <li><time>08:25</time><span data-en="Those 31 applicants get a message in Arabic or English saying exactly what is missing." data-ar="يتلقى أصحاب الـ31 رسالة بالعربية أو الإنجليزية تحدد ما ينقص بالضبط.">Those 31 applicants get a message in Arabic or English saying exactly what is missing.</span></li>
          <li><time>09:00</time><span data-en="Staff start the day with 109 complete files. Every decision stays with them." data-ar="يبدأ الموظفون يومهم بـ109 ملفات مكتملة. وكل قرار يبقى بيدهم.">Staff start the day with 109 complete files. Every decision stays with them.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="after" data-en="BRXDXB has no government client to name. This is how a pilot would run." data-ar="لا تذكر BRXDXB أي جهة حكومية كعميل. هكذا يسير المشروع التجريبي.">BRXDXB has no government client to name. This is how a pilot would run.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
